Debug instrumentation for scripts/emdf_tool.py.

With ICLF_BITPOS set, the E-AC-3 decoder prints each audio block's skip-field
position, block end and the end of the audio data to stderr.

---

diff --git a/libs/ac3/src/decoder/eac3_decoder.cpp b/libs/ac3/src/decoder/eac3_decoder.cpp
index 7b7c371..3128639 100644
--- a/libs/ac3/src/decoder/eac3_decoder.cpp
+++ b/libs/ac3/src/decoder/eac3_decoder.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
